        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Hokkaido/_scene_snowcrane.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository ab7da4b9-fb66-4d25-acfe-9a8d58c4ffbc).Image",
        "Description": "We have intel from our heat-vision cameras that suggests these four individuals didn&apos;t flush the toilet after using it. Now they must pay the price for breaking a unlisted rule of the world. You must eliminate these four with stealth and cautiousness, as if you get caught or a body gets found you have no chance to live as one bullet from a guard will land you in the morgue. These four should&apos;ve flushed the toilet after pooping. Goodluck 47.",
